      HOWCALC
THIS APL HAS NO WAY TO HAND ONE FUNCTION TO ANOTHER, SO A
FUNCTION IS NAMED: ONE CHARACTER OF FNS, WHICH AT TURNS INTO
THE PRIMITIVE BY A TABLE, OR A VECTOR OF COEFFICIENTS, WHICH
AT EVALUATES AS A POLYNOMIAL. 'S' AT 1 IS THE SINE OF 1; 1 0 0
AT 3 IS 9.

INTEG IS SIMPSON'S RULE: THE VALUES AT EVENLY SPACED POINTS
WEIGHTED 1 4 2 4 ... 2 4 1, TIMES A THIRD OF THE STEP; A[3]
IS MADE EVEN IF IT IS NOT. IT IS EXACT FOR A CUBIC. INTEGV
DOES THE SAME OVER VALUES YOU SUPPLY, BY SIMPSON WHEN THERE
IS AN ODD NUMBER OF THEM AND BY THE TRAPEZIUM RULE WHEN NOT.

DERIV IS THE CENTRAL DIFFERENCE OVER A STEP OF 1E¯5. NEWTON
STEPS X BY MINUS F OVER THAT DERIVATIVE UNTIL THE STEP IS
UNDER 1E¯12, AT MOST FIFTY TIMES. BISECT HALVES THE INTERVAL
SIXTY TIMES, WHICH NEEDS F TO CHANGE SIGN ACROSS IT; IF IT
DOES NOT, BISECT SAYS SO AND GIVES A[1].

SERIES ADDS TERMS UNTIL ONE IS SMALLER THAN T: FOR E, THE
RECIPROCAL FACTORIALS; FOR PI, NILAKANTHA'S 3+4÷2×3×4 LESS
4÷4×5×6 AND SO ON; FOR SIN 1, THE ODD POWERS OVER THEIR
FACTORIALS WITH ALTERNATING SIGNS. EACH LINE GIVES THE SUM,
THE TERMS TAKEN, AND THE PRIMITIVE'S VALUE TO COMPARE.
